   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "vpy_blr_631",
   "en": "That's exactly why we need the song. Her voice.",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "vpy_blr_632",
   "en": "I'll protect you. Sing without fear, Ranka.",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "vpy_blr_633",
   "en": "That's right. Now, Ranka, protect this beautiful planet. That is your atonement.",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "vpy_blr_634",
   "en": "Get away from my sister!",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "vpy_blr_635",
   "en": "This is our mission, brother and sister: protecting the Vajra's home planet from invaders.",
