   "flags": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "vpy_blr_639",
   "en": "Thanks to that hit, I finally broke free of their control.",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "vpy_blr_640",
